# Trinetra Foundation Redirects Configuration
# 301 Redirect secondary domain (.site) and legacy domain (.org) to primary canonical domain (.in)
https://trinetrafoundation.site/* https://trinetrafoundation.in/:splat 301!
http://trinetrafoundation.site/* https://trinetrafoundation.in/:splat 301!
https://trinetrafoundation.org/* https://trinetrafoundation.in/:splat 301!
http://trinetrafoundation.org/* https://trinetrafoundation.in/:splat 301!
